  "notes": [
    "Groups: three groups (two of four teams playing a double round robin, one of three playing each opponent four times), Bo1; the top two advance, ties across 2nd/3rd are played off. Rumble: six teams, double round robin, Bo1; the top four advance, ties split by head-to-head, ties across 4th/5th played off. Knockout: Bo5 semifinals (1st vs 4th, 2nd vs 3rd) and final.",
    "MSI 2022 group results exclude three nullified series that were replayed.",
    "Formats, series lengths, tiebreaker games and placements are verified by replaying the recorded results.",
    "Not modelled: the group draw rules. Forward simulations draw groups randomly."
  ],
